      "suggested_text": "These places were made[a] for them to dwell in until the day of their judgment and until their appointed time, a period extending until the great judgment upon them.[b]",
      "footnote_changes": "Replace all notes. a: '“Were made” repairs the marked active wording. Charles’s note 31 reports the passive correction in manuscript m and relates the transmitted form to a corruption in Greek G.' b: 'The English smooths the repeated time expressions. Charles brackets the qualification [ውእቱ፡ ዘየዓቢ፡]; it is not incorporated here as an unqualified assertion that the period is long. The relevant continuation of the apparatus is not among the supplied images.'",
